<title>USA: N.Y. State $592 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>N.Y. State $592 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it repriced New York State Urban Development Corp's $592 million bond issue, raising yields in several maturities and lifting the top yield in 2026 to 5.88 percent from 5.86 percent.</p>
